Date: Mon, 2 Mar 2026 02:03:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 206/244] Auto-detect currency for trades and orders

Update the proxy to auto-detect currency from instrument data instead of hardcoding it. Modify the dashboard and trading bot to use the detected currency or fallback to AUD, resolving currency code validation errors.

